# Docker build context for deployment/redactplus/Dockerfile.
#
# Allowlist: everything is excluded, then only what `npm ci` and `next build` need is
# re-included. Screenshot masters (assets/), documentation, tests, the OAuth broker,
# local environment files, Git metadata and build output never enter the context, so
# they cannot reach any image layer.
*

!package.json
!package-lock.json
!next.config.ts
!tsconfig.json
!postcss.config.js
!tailwind.config.ts
!.eslintrc.json

!src
!public
!content
!config
!scripts

# Re-excluded inside the allowed directories. The last matching rule wins.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/node_modules
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
# A generated CMS file would shadow the runtime /admin/config.yml route.
public/admin/config.yml
